WEBVTT

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:19.240
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.140
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:22.950
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.400
Who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:35.650
They call me calm, strong, and cool. {cool de tsuyoku...}

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:40.000
Everyone says I'm popular.{iketeru to...}

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.410
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. {honto wa...}

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:46.620
I'm just an ordinary girl! {futsuu ni...}

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:50.730
I wish I could just get rid {puressha nank...}

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:54.510
of all this pressure and be myself. {sunao ni naritai...}

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:58.350
But they'd all say it's out of character. {kyarajanai toka...}

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:02.760
Unlock my heart! {atashi no kokoro...}

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:08.110
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:10.960
Your Guardian Characters are with you. {shugo kyara ga...}

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:15.210
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:18.280
It'll be okay, really! {zenzen...}

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:23.190
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:25.960
Having only one style would be way too boring. {hitotsu...}

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:30.220
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:34.490
You can do anything! {nandatte...}

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:36.110
I know that...{kitto}

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:37.950
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:39.840
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:41.710
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:43.020
...is who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:48.720
Hello, Hinamori Amu's Guardian Characters.

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:50.970
N-Nikaidou-sensei?

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:53.850
Nikaidou!

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:01.180
Well, have a nice day.

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:03.280
Wait!

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:04.140
Give it up.

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:06.600
Ran! Miki! Su!

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:09.050
Amu-chan!

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:18.890
Guardian Character Rescue Operation!

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:18.890
Episode 22

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:20.150
Okay!

00:02:20.150 --> 00:02:21.640
Let's go!

00:02:22.010 --> 00:02:22.660
And?

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:24.260
Where do you intend on going?

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:27.850
Aren't we going to march straight into Easter?

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:29.050
If we did that,

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:30.890
we'd end up getting arrested by security.

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:35.140
Besides, if what Tsukiyomi Ikuto said is true,

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:39.010
Nikaidou might not be at Easter's headquarters right now.

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:42.140
We'll have to figure out where the enemy is first.

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:45.220
I guess that means it's our turn to shine.

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:47.950
You know where they are?

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:48.970
Of course.

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:50.700
Did you forget?

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:55.880
We Guardian Characters can sort of sense each others' presences.

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:58.450
We call it our "sort of radar!"

00:02:58.450 --> 00:02:59.970
Are we gonna be okay?

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:02.780
This is still better than nothing.

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:04.750
We have nothing else to rely on now.

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.600
You're pretty harsh, Tadase.

00:03:10.310 --> 00:03:11.280
Pepe-chan.

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:13.440
Any response from your "sort of radar?"

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:15.230
Nothing yet.

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:17.310
Why are you whispering?

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:19.030
We're on recon.

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:20.110
We're not allowed to stand out!

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:21.270
Oh.

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:22.800
It's the Guardians!

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:23.790
Hey!

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:24.320
Yo.

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:26.310
Except you're drawing a whole crowd!

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:29.110
At least take your capes off!

00:03:29.110 --> 00:03:30.970
But then I won't look cool.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:32.220
Did you also feel that, Temari-tan?

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:32.950
Yes.

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:33.930
Same here.

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:36.180
We can sense a Guardian Character nearby.

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:36.950
Huh?

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:37.680
Really?

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:39.610
Okay, let's go people.

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:42.420
Okay, Hinamori-san, wait here.

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:43.140
Huh?

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:44.180
I'm coming with you!

00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:46.100
Don't you get it?

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:49.320
You can't Character Change or Character Transform right now.

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:51.180
It'd be dangerous if something happened.

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:52.390
Let's go!

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:55.430
See ya, Hinamori!

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:57.110
Guys...

00:04:01.810 --> 00:04:03.200
Coming to you live...

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.430
Saeki Nobuko's...

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:06.790
Anything Supernatural Café!

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.790
On Tour!

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.790
Anything Supernatural Café!

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:11.270
We're reporting from the recently popular Felice Café!

00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:13.610
And today's guest is

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:16.560
the red-hot, debut hit super idol:

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:19.930
Hoshina Utau-chan!

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:24.020
Utau.

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:28.130
Let's get this stupid job over with and go have fun.

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:30.070
Be quiet, Il.

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:31.720
Gosh, you're no fun.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:34.180
Let's move to our first corner!

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:36.540
Tales of the Suddenly Supernatural!

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:37.950
Question one!

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:40.960
Do you believe in guardian spirits, Utau-chan?

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:44.930
Yes.

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:46.780
Oh!

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:49.770
It appears that Utau-chan believes in guardian spirits!

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:51.570
Honestly, that Utau.

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:53.190
I told her to smile more.

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:54.740
Honestly, Madame.

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:56.770
The show's already begun!

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.640
Madame! Madame Saeki!

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:00.270
Please hurry it up!

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:01.630
Shut your trap!

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:02.870
I can't do anything about it.

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:04.770
My make-up isn't finished yet.

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:07.060
You're absolutely right, Madame.

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:08.890
Absolutely right, Madame.

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:10.560
I'm pooped.

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:13.900
Besides, I'm not some kind of charismatic fortune-teller.

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:17.120
I'm just a normal old lady!

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:18.780
You!

00:05:18.780 --> 00:05:20.780
Bring her some cold water!

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:28.690
Sure, I can see and hear things every once in a while. {hey could someone please check this saeki monologue to see if i got the timings right please? el}

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:30.350
But sometimes I can't see anything.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:34.440
I randomly mentioned something about a message from a guardian spirit one day,

00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:36.970
and the next thing I know, it's a big hit.

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:40.440
I actually can't stand the occult!

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:43.600
Everything I see and hear is just my imagination!

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:47.660
I'm not an elite big shot!

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:51.780
I'm just a regular housewife who likes miso peanuts!

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:52.240
Hey, do the usual.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:52.680
Yes.

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:56.640
Nobuko! Charisma!

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:59.050
Charismatic Nobuko has come!

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:00.390
It's your theme song, Madame.

00:05:59.050 --> 00:06:00.910
La-la-la Nobuko!

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:03.680
A million housewives around the nation are waiting for you!

00:06:00.910 --> 00:06:06.020
Nobuko Lu-la-la-la-la-la!

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:06.020
Now, deliver your catch phrase!

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:09.810
Who do you think I am?

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:12.720
Saeki Nobuko!

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:12.720
Hooray!

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:14.900
That's more like it!

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:16.050
Wh-What's going on in there?

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:16.050
Wonderful!

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:20.910
They told me to wait here,

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:24.270
but I can't just sit here by myself.

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:25.090
Yep!

00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:26.020
I can still...

00:06:26.930 --> 00:06:28.890
"Sort of radar!"

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:35.230
I'm sorry.

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:36.520
I was being unreasonable.

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:39.250
Yes.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:40.440
Yes.

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:42.400
I understand.

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:44.890
In that case, I'll request a report.

00:06:44.890 --> 00:06:46.560
I'll speak with you later.

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:51.350
They've done a number of things using the black cat.

00:06:51.350 --> 00:06:53.890
But soon enough, not even the Director will be able to complain.

00:06:56.700 --> 00:07:00.000
The one to present the Embryo to the Boss

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.330
will be me.

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:07.100
It came from somewhere around here.

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:11.390
What's with the huge crowd?

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:14.470
Maybe they're shooting a television program.

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:17.770
I'll go scout out the situation.

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:20.550
Madame Saeki sure is late.

00:07:20.550 --> 00:07:22.180
I wonder what happened.

00:07:22.180 --> 00:07:25.070
The supernatural fortune-teller Saeki Nobuko is coming!

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:26.550
Let's watch! Let's watch!

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:27.210
Honestly.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.340
Now is not the time.

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:30.100
No.

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:31.520
Let's go.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:33.420
Perhaps...

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:36.910
Madame Saeki is making her entrance!

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:39.880
Madame, knock them out!

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:42.700
Give that uppity idol one of your usual spicy fortunes!

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:45.110
I know.

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:49.570
But I have a hard time working with that Hoshina Utau girl.

00:07:50.310 --> 00:07:54.810
I can see some strange small thing behind her sometimes.

00:07:57.940 --> 00:08:00.470
That would be a Guardian Character.

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:04.940
Madame, what's wrong?

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:07.550
Gh-Gho-Ghost!

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:08.920
I'm not a ghost.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.220
I'm a Guardian Character.

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:14.050
It would appear that this person can see us.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:15.440
Her face is huge.

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:18.100
Gu-Guar-Guardian spirits?

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:20.290
Oh no, no, no!

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:21.870
Madame!

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:29.480
Sorry to intrude.

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:30.170
Sup.

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:32.610
Wow! It's the real thing!

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:34.270
That's rude, Yaya-chan.

00:08:34.270 --> 00:08:35.440
That's right.

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:37.430
You have to go through my manager if you want a picture.

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:38.470
Or not that!

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:39.410
Who are you people?

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:40.930
When did you get in here?

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:43.450
We slipped in during all the commotion.

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:46.430
Forgive us. We needed to ask you something.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:49.350
That's right, Madame Saeki.

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:52.430
The truth is that we're in a lot of trouble right now.

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:54.180
Oh my, what a pretty boy.

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:56.930
Well, he's nothing compared to me.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:58.820
I can't see it! I can't see it!

00:08:58.820 --> 00:08:59.870
I can't hear it!

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:01.680
It's all a lie! All fabricated!

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:02.860
Don't worry.

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:04.470
They won't harm you.

00:09:04.470 --> 00:09:05.430
Naturally.

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:09.070
I apologize for startling you.

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:11.120
But you're truly amazing, Madame Saeki.

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:13.350
You can even see our Guardian Characters.

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:14.840
You're no ordinary person.

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:16.970
Well, I wouldn't go that far.

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:19.820
If she can indeed see us,

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:22.550
perhaps she will be able to sense Ran and the others.

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:25.760
Besides, it isn't very encouraging when your "sort of radar" is all we have to go on.

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:27.990
You're pretty harsh, aren't you, Nadeshiko?

00:09:28.510 --> 00:09:31.970
We're looking for our friend's Guardian Characters.

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:34.670
Could you lend us a hand, Madame?

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:36.470
Wh-What should I do?

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:37.830
Incidentally...

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:39.830
Do you think he's doing that consciously?

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:41.370
That's probably just his nature.

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:42.540
Tadase...

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:44.880
What's going on?

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:46.540
Madame Nobuko is really late.

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:47.870
Uh...

00:09:47.870 --> 00:09:51.040
Madame Saeki is communicating with spirits at the moment,

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:53.930
so there'll be a switch in the program as we put on a little skit.

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:55.430
What?

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.520
Hey, what's going on here?

00:09:57.520 --> 00:09:59.600
Today's the only opening in our schedule!

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:05.100
I don't know what's going on, but this is getting interesting!

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:06.310
Worthless.

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:07.250
Do it!

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:09.770
Turn everything into a mess!

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:17.190
What do I do?

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:20.150
Maybe I should have just waited there.

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:23.060
I ended up getting separated from Tadase-kun and everyone else.

00:10:26.550 --> 00:10:27.850
Amu-chan!

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:29.290
Amu-chan.

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:30.810
Amu-chan!

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:33.590
Where are they?

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:35.810
Hinamori Amu.

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:41.020
Hoshina Utau.

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:57.310
Hoshina Utau.

00:10:57.310 --> 00:11:00.270
What are you doing here?

00:11:00.270 --> 00:11:02.570
What about you?

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:04.640
I asked you a question.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:06.880
Utau!

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:08.160
You aren't gonna watch?

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:11.030
Panic, panic, mayhem!

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:12.490
Hinamori Amu.

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:17.270
Don't tell me the Guardian Character they all sensed was...

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:18.810
Oh.

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:20.680
So it wasn't Ran and the others.

00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:22.170
Ran?

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:23.840
Your Guardian Character?

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:24.860
That's right.

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:27.430
I don't see your Guardian Characters around today.

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:28.960
Not that I care,

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:30.060
but why is that?

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:32.200
You do care.

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:34.260
I said that I don't.

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:35.870
So, why is that?

00:11:35.870 --> 00:11:37.580
What a stubborn personality.

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:42.180
So bored.

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:45.310
I see.

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:48.450
Nikaidou-san's making some audacious moves.

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:50.310
You know about Nikaidou-sensei?

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:52.330
I mean, Nikaidou.

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:53.270
More or less.

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:58.350
Easter has more than one team searching for the Embryo.

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:01.900
Nikaidou-san and my manager, Sanjo-san,

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:04.550
are competing to see who can find it first.

00:12:05.310 --> 00:12:10.020
Whoever finds the Embryo will be on the fast track to promotion.

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:11.550
Promotion?

00:12:11.550 --> 00:12:14.790
Doesn't the Embryo grant your wishes?

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:16.960
Yet they're handing it over to the company?

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:17.520
Why's that?

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:21.740
Who can know how an adult's mind works?

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:25.290
Maybe prestige is more important than dreams or wishes?

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:29.580
I can't stand the methods used by Nikaidou-san, though.

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:30.930
They aren't fair.

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:32.100
Utau...

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:36.430
I wouldn't use cheap tricks on a fledgling like you.

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:39.970
I can obtain the Embryo without sinking that low.

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:43.220
And I'll save Ikuto from Easter.

00:12:43.250 --> 00:12:45.640
Save Ikuto?

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:47.410
Don't talk about him so intimately!

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:47.930
Huh?

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:49.510
I-I wasn't...

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:52.430
Ikuto's issues have nothing to do with you!

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:54.140
I won't lose...

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:55.930
I won't lose to someone like you!

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:03.790
At first, I started looking for the Embryo to get Tadase-kun's attention.

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:06.100
But it's different now.

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:08.100
I won't lose either!

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:14.020
Sorry, but I won't give up a millimeter to someone who puts X's on other peoples' eggs!

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:16.660
If you don't finish what you set out to do,

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:18.520
your Character will have been wasted!

00:13:25.520 --> 00:13:26.100
Huh?

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:32.880
Geez, Ami-chi!

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:34.340
You weren't supposed to move!

00:13:34.340 --> 00:13:36.390
We might know where Ran and the others are!

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:37.310
Huh?

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:38.100
Really?

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:42.820
We recruited a super powerful radar to replace the "sort of radar!"

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:46.310
Madame Saeki Nobuko is helping us out.

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:48.770
That bogus fortune-teller?

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:50.540
The "bogus" was unnecessary!

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:54.540
Why am I doing this?

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:57.340
We need your help, Madame Saeki.

00:13:57.340 --> 00:14:00.820
Besides, you're the only one here who can drive.

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:03.020
Well, if you're going to go that far.

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:04.610
Let's go, Hinamori!

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:05.360
Okay.

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:06.520
Wait.

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:08.240
I'm coming with you.

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:09.540
Even if we're both from Easter,

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:11.720
I can't excuse his cowardly methods.

00:14:11.720 --> 00:14:13.020
I can't simply turn a blind eye.

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:14.410
Hoshina Utau!

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:15.930
The real deal!

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:21.520
The two of us might be kind of similar.

00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:23.310
Okay, everyone!

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:24.380
Let's go!

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:25.350
Okay!

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:27.240
She seems pretty pumped.

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:28.970
It appears she's dealt with any qualms she had.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:30.050
Go!

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:31.180
Full speed ahead!

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:32.700
Yeah!

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:38.270
Madame, where are you going?

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:40.350
The show's completely ruined!

00:14:43.140 --> 00:14:45.180
Y-You're going too fast!

00:14:46.430 --> 00:14:48.180
Hit that pedal to the metal!

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:49.540
Whoa, Madame!

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:50.640
The light's red!

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:51.790
Stop!

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:00.180
Th-This is really dangerous, you know!

00:15:00.450 --> 00:15:01.880
That's not my fault.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:03.610
I have a license, but no car!

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:06.600
Old lady, you sure this is the right way?

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:08.560
Of course...

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:10.520
I'm just guessing at random!

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:12.020
Baby on board!

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:12.740
Yeah! Yeah!

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:14.560
Save us!

00:15:24.630 --> 00:15:27.680
I wonder where we're going.

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:31.120
Probably to wherever the person he was on the phone with is.

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:32.720
Did you feel that?

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:34.370
This feeling is...

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:36.350
Ran-tan and the others!

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:37.480
Really?

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:38.810
Where are they?

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:40.180
A T-Junction!

00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:41.110
Which way?

00:15:41.110 --> 00:15:41.890
Right!

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:43.190
Go left!

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:45.640
This way!

00:15:48.430 --> 00:15:49.730
Nikaidou.

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:50.430
Stop the car!

00:15:50.430 --> 00:15:51.180
Got it!

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:57.520
Nikaidou!

00:15:57.520 --> 00:15:58.910
What a surprise.

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:01.430
I'm amazed you were able to find your way here, Himamori-san.

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:03.940
Hurry up and give my Guardian Eggs back already!

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:05.550
Guardian Eggs?

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:07.500
Do you mean these?

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:08.970
Amu-chan!

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:11.080
Seriously?

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:11.910
Bingo!

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:13.680
Madame Nobuko's awesome!

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:16.270
Thank you very much, Madame.

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:22.110
Nikaidou.

00:16:22.110 --> 00:16:22.960
Whoa there.

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:24.600
You shouldn't move.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:28.600
I might accidentally crush these eggs.

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:31.160
Nikaidou-san.

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:33.540
You aren't acting very cool.

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:38.730
You shouldn't need X Eggs or her Guardian Eggs if they aren't the Embryo.

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:40.750
Stop picking on the weak.

00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:42.520
The weak?

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:45.270
But it's fun.

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:47.560
The eggs of foolish children ignoring reality;

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:52.560
rambling on about hopes and dreams.

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:57.220
Taking those eggs is so much fun I can't help myself.

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:01.310
And it's not as if I don't need them.

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:04.220
They're going to be ingredients in my recipe.

00:17:04.550 --> 00:17:08.280
I know you've been doing something in secret,

00:17:08.280 --> 00:17:09.970
but what exactly are you planning?

00:17:10.260 --> 00:17:12.180
That's what I'd like to ask.

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:16.620
I thought that you'd merely disappeared from the filming location.

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:19.720
But you were with the Guardian Hinamori Amu.

00:17:19.980 --> 00:17:22.060
Aren't you on the wrong side here?

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:25.580
You're such a naughty girl to sneak around behind my back.

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:27.510
Oh, well.

00:17:27.510 --> 00:17:29.620
Come back to this side already.

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:33.440
Besides, those annoying kids have conveniently gathered in one place.

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:35.600
Eliminate all of them out together.

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:39.610
My, how rebellious.

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:42.370
Don't you care what happens to Ikuto-kun?

00:17:44.820 --> 00:17:45.530
Il.

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:47.170
That's my cue!

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:51.060
My heart: Unlock!

00:17:51.060 --> 00:17:52.390
Could it be...

00:17:52.390 --> 00:17:53.680
A Character Transformation?

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:09.080
Character Transformation: Lunatic Charm!

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:12.930
Sorry, but I need you all to get lost!

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:14.020
Utau.

00:18:14.020 --> 00:18:15.650
Get back, Hinamori!

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:17.180
Leave this to us!

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:19.890
Character Change!

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:23.420
My, it's like a school art festival.

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:26.140
You believe you can defeat Utau with a mere Character Change?

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:27.270
Utau.

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:28.200
Why?

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:30.370
You said you couldn't excuse cowardly methods!

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:31.390
Was that a lie?

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:32.730
Utau!

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:36.720
Nightmare Lorelei!

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:38.640
Holy Crown!

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:46.740
Utau!

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:47.810
Why?

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:49.330
For Ikuto.

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:52.730
If it's for Ikuto, I'll be as dirty as I have to.

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:54.020
I'll do anything!

00:18:55.970 --> 00:18:58.640
I never asked you to do that.

00:18:58.640 --> 00:18:59.900
Ikuto!

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:01.610
Yo.

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:02.590
Well...

00:19:02.590 --> 00:19:04.550
A Character Transformation with Il, huh?

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:06.160
Haven't seen that in a while.

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:08.350
You must be pretty serious, Utau.

00:19:08.350 --> 00:19:09.650
This is bad.

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:13.350
She's been busy with photo shoots and hasn't seen Ikuto-kun in a while.

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:14.910
Ikuto.

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:19.520
Ikuto!

00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:20.990
What?

00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:21.690
Hey...

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:23.020
Her Character Transformation was undone.

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:24.180
Hey, Utau.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.490
I can't move.

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:26.450
It doesn't matter.

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:28.770
We can just stay like this forever!

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:30.650
What's with the honeyed voice?

00:19:30.650 --> 00:19:32.430
She's like a totally different person!

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:34.170
Utau.

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:36.380
You have it rough too, huh?

00:19:37.950 --> 00:19:39.810
Tsukiyomi Ikuto!

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:42.600
Yo, little king.

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:45.310
Are you pretending to put on a parade with your servants?

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:47.370
So you're also involved in this.

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:48.330
You thieving cat!

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:49.830
Guardians.

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:50.890
Are you going to interfere?

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:52.130
Honestly.

00:19:52.130 --> 00:19:53.980
Utau, we're leaving.

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:56.440
You've got a ton of jobs lined up.

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:57.730
Yuu, take care of this.

00:19:57.730 --> 00:19:58.640
Good grief.

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:06.770
What is this?

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:08.720
Damn, I can't see anything!

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:11.570
I'll leave the rest to you, black cat.

00:20:11.570 --> 00:20:13.560
Play all you want.

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:15.560
My eggs!

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:18.420
Sorry.

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:19.730
That wasn't on purpose.

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:21.930
Just trying to give it back!

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:27.670
Ran!

00:20:27.670 --> 00:20:28.400
Amu-chan!

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:29.350
Character Change!

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:37.520
You did it!

00:20:40.820 --> 00:20:41.900
Miki.

00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:43.250
Amu-chan!

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:46.180
Su!

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:47.810
Can't be helped.

00:20:47.810 --> 00:20:50.030
Guess I'll have to live with just one.

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:52.310
A-Amu-chan!

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:54.930
Give me back my egg!

00:20:54.930 --> 00:20:56.930
Why are you doing this?

00:20:56.930 --> 00:20:59.180
What's so fun about it?

00:20:59.180 --> 00:21:00.870
Your methods are too dark!

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:03.520
Acting dishonest and stealing other peoples' eggs,

00:21:03.520 --> 00:21:06.100
just because you don't have one!

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:13.390
Fine.

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:15.550
If you're going to push it,

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:17.390
I'll give you a chance.

00:21:17.390 --> 00:21:21.480
Come to my lab after school tomorrow.

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:24.390
It's inside a former Easter employee dorm on the outskirts of town.

00:21:24.390 --> 00:21:27.490
But you have to come alone.

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:30.390
Keep this a secret from your Guardian buddies.

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:37.390
Try not to be late for show time,

00:21:37.870 --> 00:21:39.440
Hinamori Amu.

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:45.060
Huh?

00:21:45.310 --> 00:21:47.290
Everybody's gone.

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:47.980
Man.

00:21:47.980 --> 00:21:49.520
Did they get away?

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:50.900
Hinamori-san.

00:21:50.900 --> 00:21:52.620
Are you all right, Amu-chan?

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:54.120
Uh-huh.

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:56.010
Amu-chan!

00:21:56.450 --> 00:21:57.920
It's okay.

00:21:57.920 --> 00:21:59.520
It's okay now.

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:01.530
Amu-chan.

00:22:01.530 --> 00:22:03.770
Su will be okay, right?

00:22:03.770 --> 00:22:04.780
Yeah.

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:07.420
We'll all be together again tomorrow.

00:22:11.730 --> 00:22:13.390
After school tomorrow...

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:15.780
Hold on, Su.

00:22:15.780 --> 00:22:17.560
I'll definitely save you!

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:41.390
Unless the world ends, I'll always {sekai ga...}

00:22:41.390 --> 00:22:44.160
love you!  Yeah, you! {suki da yo...}

00:22:44.160 --> 00:22:47.630
'Cause I just love, love, love you! {suki suki suki...}

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:52.360
Sure, I might struggle, but I'm still living. {jitabata...}

00:22:52.360 --> 00:22:55.040
So figure it out already! Yeah, you! {kizukeyo...}

00:22:55.040 --> 00:22:58.680
Even though I love, love, love you, {suki suki suki...}

00:22:59.380 --> 00:23:04.870
I wanna say it but, shoot, I just can't! {iitaikuseni...}

00:23:04.870 --> 00:23:08.990
I wanna show you what's in my heart! {tsutaetai...}

00:23:08.990 --> 00:23:12.420
Oh yes! You're my one true hero. {oh yes!...}

00:23:12.420 --> 00:23:17.580
Being in love's gonna be a bumpy ride.  {koishiterukagiri...}

00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:23.510
But keep going! Okay, greenhorn rider? {hashitsuzukero...}

00:23:23.510 --> 00:23:28.760
Straight down the path, into the sunset, stronger and stronger. {yuuyake...}

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:37.630
Ride through the wild land of youth. {seishun no...}

00:23:49.970 --> 00:23:51.890
This is awful, just awful, Amu-chan!

00:23:51.890 --> 00:23:53.670
Su was taken!

00:23:53.670 --> 00:23:55.060
I won't let you get away with this, Nikaidou!

00:23:55.060 --> 00:23:57.710
Su, I'm coming to save you!

00:23:57.710 --> 00:23:59.510
Ah, so busy, so busy.

00:23:59.510 --> 00:24:01.570
Make the tea. Bubble, bubble, bubble.

00:24:01.570 --> 00:24:03.590
Clean the room. Sweep, sweep, sweep.

00:24:03.590 --> 00:24:05.780
I have so much work to do!

00:24:05.780 --> 00:24:07.060
What are you doing?

00:24:07.060 --> 00:24:09.820
We were all worried!

00:24:09.820 --> 00:24:11.060
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.060 --> 00:24:13.280
Remake Honey! Who I want to be!

00:24:13.280 --> 00:24:14.810
We've finally reached the climax!

00:24:14.810 --> 00:24:16.300
A huge plot twist!

00:24:16.300 --> 00:24:19.660
If you don't watch, you'll regret it for a hundred years!
